    "params.json is a parameter set of Praxis for the reference statement at 100-bit security whose ciphertext is 6854 MiB (6.6931 GiB) and whose time, one encryption plus one expected decryption, is 1037864 million field multiplications (17317 and 1020547), by the protected model, and every rule of the model as amended holds for it; proof.md proves that each amended entry (I3, Ncmp, I6, I4, n2, dec_msm_g1, dec_msm_g2, dec_pairings, n1, C6, n, C7, H2) is sound, so that the paper's theorems hold for these parameters as rules.md requires."
